    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: a drive-by (CE-4621 IM-1, the throw; docs/designs/vehicle-tactics/DESIGN_Motorcycle.md \u00a75). A two-up insurgent motorcycle ('Bike': 'Rider' in front, 'Pillion' in the firing seat) rides east along the road at y = 200 at 14 m/s, slows to 4 m/s within 40 m of a two-man sentry post ('Sentry 1', 'Sentry 2' at x 200-206, 14 m off the road), the pillion throws ONE grenade at the post while passing, and the bike escapes at speed to (390, 200), the east edge of the town. Judge: (1) the pillion throws: a burst goes off at the post (within 15 m of Sentry 1) (2) a sentry is hurt (3) the bike passes the post (within 20 m of (200, 200)) (4) the bike escapes: past x = 340 (140 m beyond the post) by 70 s (5) the riders are still aboard at the end. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh ua-moto-drive-by-grenade"
  },
